WEBVTT

00:00:08.638 --> 00:00:10.553
-[yells wildly]
-[gasps, screams]

00:00:10.727 --> 00:00:12.207
[whooping]

00:00:12.381 --> 00:00:13.774
-[grunting]
-Ow.

00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:15.123
[groans]
It went in my mouth.

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:16.864
[heavy footsteps rumbling]

00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:17.952
[all gasp]

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:20.345
[distant roaring]

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.260
[shrieks]

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.436
[excited chatter, grunting]

00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:28.832
[grunts softly]

00:00:29.006 --> 00:00:30.268
[heavy footsteps rumbling]

00:00:30.442 --> 00:00:33.750
[distant roaring]

00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:37.493
Well, I guess this is it.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:41.236
Phil, I'm sorry
I ate your bananas.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.980
I suppose perhaps
I have made mistakes, too.

00:00:47.111 --> 00:00:49.331
Like weaponizing these monkeys?

00:00:49.505 --> 00:00:50.332
Well, yeah.

00:00:50.506 --> 00:00:51.681
Or stealing their water?

00:00:51.855 --> 00:00:53.204
Mm.

00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:54.771
And-and teaching them
to tie these knots?

00:00:54.945 --> 00:00:56.730
Well, their knots
were atrocious!

00:00:56.904 --> 00:00:58.775
-[heavy footstep rumbles]
-[distant roaring]

00:01:00.342 --> 00:01:04.128
I just wish I'd been able
to see Eep one more time.

00:01:05.782 --> 00:01:07.567
I spent my whole life
searching for a place

00:01:07.741 --> 00:01:11.832
my parents wanted me to find,
and I found it.

00:01:12.006 --> 00:01:15.966
But now all I can
think about is Eep.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.360
My best friend.

00:01:18.534 --> 00:01:21.668
My first and only love.

00:01:23.278 --> 00:01:25.672
You know, your parents
loved you very much.

00:01:25.846 --> 00:01:30.546
I think all they wanted for you
was to find happiness.

00:01:31.982 --> 00:01:34.289
And if there's one thing I know,

00:01:34.463 --> 00:01:37.901
it's that you and Eep
make each other happy.

00:01:39.076 --> 00:01:41.339
Guy, there's no one I'd rather

00:01:41.513 --> 00:01:45.822
my daughter spend
her Tomorrow with than you.

00:01:45.996 --> 00:01:48.259
Guy, I too give you permission

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:50.174
to start a home
with Grug's daughter.

00:01:50.348 --> 00:01:52.742
-That's not how it works.
-But it is appreciated.

00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:54.048
And you two twits are

00:01:54.222 --> 00:01:55.745
the closest thing I have
to fathers.

00:01:55.919 --> 00:01:57.094
Thanks, son.

00:01:57.268 --> 00:01:58.966
We're not so different
after all, Grug.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.621
We're two
profoundly foolish fathers

00:02:01.795 --> 00:02:03.405
obsessed with bananas...

00:02:03.579 --> 00:02:05.059
-[heavy footstep rumbles]
-[all grunt]

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:08.715
...about to die
an incredibly ironic death.

00:02:08.889 --> 00:02:10.673
[heavy footstep rumbles]

00:02:14.068 --> 00:02:15.330
[excited chatter]

00:02:15.504 --> 00:02:16.984
PHIL:
Grug, what's going on?

00:02:18.072 --> 00:02:19.508
I don't know! I can't see.

00:02:19.682 --> 00:02:21.336
[all grunting]

00:02:29.474 --> 00:02:30.301
[Phil screams]

00:02:30.475 --> 00:02:31.607
I can't look.

00:02:31.781 --> 00:02:33.000
What is it?

00:02:33.174 --> 00:02:35.480
It's... it's... it's...

00:02:36.438 --> 00:02:37.352
[squeaks]

00:02:37.526 --> 00:02:39.397
...actually kind of cute.

00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:42.139
[growls]

00:02:42.313 --> 00:02:44.533
That's just its forehead?
Oh, come on!

00:02:44.707 --> 00:02:47.188
[roars]

00:02:48.189 --> 00:02:49.712
[all scream]

00:02:49.886 --> 00:02:51.105
[gasps]

00:02:52.454 --> 00:02:55.022
-[all scream]
-[excited grunting]

00:02:55.196 --> 00:02:57.764
-[wild yelling in distance]
-What the... -[confused grunt]

00:02:57.938 --> 00:03:00.767
["Feel the Thunder"
by Haim playing]

00:03:00.941 --> 00:03:04.292
Thunder Sisters!

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:06.511
-Eep!
-[roars]

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.599
♪ Come on... ♪

00:03:07.774 --> 00:03:09.210
What the heck is that?

00:03:09.384 --> 00:03:10.428
[growls]

00:03:11.647 --> 00:03:14.606
[wild shouting]

00:03:14.781 --> 00:03:18.480
[whooping]

00:03:18.654 --> 00:03:20.351
♪ Can you hear? ♪

00:03:20.525 --> 00:03:22.658
♪ The sisters of thunder
are near ♪

00:03:22.832 --> 00:03:24.399
-[yelling]
-♪ Crash, boom-pow ♪

00:03:24.573 --> 00:03:25.922
-[roaring] -♪ It's coming
right through the clouds ♪

00:03:26.096 --> 00:03:28.185
♪ I got a need for speed ♪

00:03:28.359 --> 00:03:30.231
♪ Gonna bring you
down to your knees ♪

00:03:30.405 --> 00:03:32.146
♪ It's big, it's loud... ♪

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.582
Fire Heart, heads up!

00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:35.192
[yelling]

00:03:35.366 --> 00:03:37.020
[distorted yelling]

00:03:37.194 --> 00:03:38.935
♪ Feel it quaking ♪

00:03:39.109 --> 00:03:40.371
♪ But you want more ♪

00:03:40.545 --> 00:03:41.677
♪ Feel the thunder... ♪

00:03:41.851 --> 00:03:42.983
[distorted yelling]

00:03:43.157 --> 00:03:44.375
[distorted roaring]

00:03:44.549 --> 00:03:45.550
♪ Feel the thunder... ♪

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:48.815
[snarling]

00:03:48.989 --> 00:03:50.686
[shrieking]

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.644
-♪ Feel the noise ♪
-♪ Feel the noise♪

00:03:52.819 --> 00:03:54.690
♪ Feel the thunder, uh-huh ♪

00:03:54.864 --> 00:03:57.693
♪ 'Cause we're in the mood
to destroy... ♪

00:03:57.867 --> 00:03:59.390
[yells]

00:03:59.564 --> 00:04:00.870
Wow.

00:04:01.044 --> 00:04:03.177
-[screaming]
-No, no, no, no, no!

00:04:03.351 --> 00:04:05.048
-Dad!
-♪ Come on, sisters... ♪

00:04:05.222 --> 00:04:08.095
[screaming, straining]

00:04:09.705 --> 00:04:10.793
No!

00:04:10.967 --> 00:04:12.752
Eat wig!

00:04:12.926 --> 00:04:15.580
-♪ Feel the thunder ♪
-♪ Feel the thunder♪

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:17.104
-♪ Feel the noise ♪
-♪ Feel the noise♪

00:04:17.278 --> 00:04:19.410
♪ Feel the thunder, uh-huh... ♪

00:04:19.584 --> 00:04:21.543
[screaming, grunting]

00:04:21.717 --> 00:04:22.631
-[panting]
-[song ends]

00:04:22.805 --> 00:04:25.373
♪ ♪

00:04:27.636 --> 00:04:29.246
[grunting]

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:33.294
[screaming]

00:04:34.338 --> 00:04:36.950
-[roars]
-[shrieking]

00:04:41.868 --> 00:04:43.391
-[Phil whimpers]
-GUY: Eep!

00:04:43.565 --> 00:04:45.132
Eep, I have something to say!

00:04:45.306 --> 00:04:47.395
-So do I! [gasps]
-[snarling]

00:04:48.439 --> 00:04:51.268
-[men scream]
-[Eep grunts]

00:04:52.704 --> 00:04:53.793
[grunts]

00:04:53.967 --> 00:04:55.533
Boom! That's my girl.

00:04:55.707 --> 00:04:57.013
Boom!

00:04:57.187 --> 00:04:59.363
-[snarling]
-Hey! You hungry?

00:04:59.537 --> 00:05:01.496
Come and get me!

00:05:02.758 --> 00:05:04.455
Get to the exit!

00:05:04.629 --> 00:05:06.370
All right, boys!

00:05:06.544 --> 00:05:07.981
We're getting you out of here!

00:05:08.155 --> 00:05:10.026
-[whoops]
-Yeah!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.550
[screams]
Close one! Right?

00:05:12.724 --> 00:05:13.856
Guys?

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.553
[both grunt]

00:05:15.727 --> 00:05:16.946
Phil, are you okay?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.948
[wails]

00:05:19.122 --> 00:05:20.863
It's bad, Grug.

00:05:21.037 --> 00:05:23.083
I think I rolled my ankle.

00:05:23.257 --> 00:05:25.172
You go on. Save yourself.

00:05:25.346 --> 00:05:28.392
Nuh-uh.
Pack stays together, bro.

00:05:28.566 --> 00:05:30.481
Bro?

00:05:30.655 --> 00:05:33.093
-Bro.
-Bros.

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:34.921
-What the...?
-Best bros!

00:05:35.095 --> 00:05:36.531
-Bro-FFs!
-Oh!

00:05:36.705 --> 00:05:37.706
BOTH:
Banana bros!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.317
♪ Bros for life. ♪

00:05:40.491 --> 00:05:42.232
BOTH:
What are they doing?

00:05:42.406 --> 00:05:44.191
Hey!
Get your heads in the game!

00:05:47.237 --> 00:05:48.717
-[roaring]
-[screams]

00:05:49.718 --> 00:05:51.415
[grunts]

00:05:52.416 --> 00:05:53.678
Chunky, go!

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:55.332
[roaring]

00:05:55.506 --> 00:05:56.464
Eep!

00:05:56.638 --> 00:05:58.683
[Eep grunting]

00:06:04.733 --> 00:06:05.865
-UGGA: Grug!
-THUNK: Dad?

00:06:06.039 --> 00:06:06.996
Where are they?

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.391
I think I see something.

00:06:12.436 --> 00:06:15.570
["True" by Spandau Ballet
playing]

00:06:15.744 --> 00:06:18.529
[both scream in slow motion]

00:06:18.703 --> 00:06:20.531
[both grunt]

00:06:20.705 --> 00:06:22.316
[gasps]
Are we all here?

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.057
-Where's Guy?
-Where's Eep?

00:06:25.493 --> 00:06:27.582
[grunting]

00:06:27.756 --> 00:06:28.539
[screams]

00:06:28.713 --> 00:06:30.280
[gasps]

00:06:32.761 --> 00:06:34.545
-[gasps]
-[snarling]

00:06:34.719 --> 00:06:36.852
[roars]

00:06:37.026 --> 00:06:38.114
[gasps]

00:06:38.288 --> 00:06:40.725
Boomsies!

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.163
[distorted roar]

00:06:44.207 --> 00:06:46.209
[roaring]

00:06:48.951 --> 00:06:50.735
[grunting]

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:51.780
Whoa!

00:06:51.954 --> 00:06:53.695
[deep grunt]

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:57.003
[panting]

00:06:57.177 --> 00:06:58.918
[snarling]

